# P3.3 title scenario: no keys through the health and safety screen, then
# Start during the opening (song 0x01) at tick 4300, held 2 ticks. The game
# skips to the title screen, which starts the title theme (song 0x43,
# titlescreen.c StartTitleScreen_WithMusic). No keys after that: the title
# times out after 815 idle ticks into the class reel.
000*4300
008*2
